DSH Plugin

This distribution includes dsh-auth, derived from
https://github.com/taichuy/deepseek-harness-auth
at commit 4464052fc1dcae45622cfcef6f9cbbbaaa6004a6.
The derived implementation uses shared WebServer routes, multi-user access
control and SQLite persistence. Its Apache-2.0 license is retained.

DeepSeek Harness and other third-party dependencies retain their own licenses.
